    group: dependents
    match: [Server/Sentinel.php]
    relation: "app/Livewire/Server/Sentinel.php:86 `if ($event['serverUuid'] === $this->server->uuid) {` inside `handleSentinelRestarted($event)` at :84 - a handle that travelled through the broadcast bus from a different process, compared as a string against the one in hand to decide whether this screen is the one the restart concerned; the machine never crosses that boundary, only the handle does, so a re-issued handle makes the wrong screen claim the event"
